# Individual Differences in Visual Illusions

This repository contains all data, analysis code, figures, and manuscript files for the project:

**Mehrvarz, M., Popat, H., & Rouder, J. N. (2024).**  
*Individual Differences in Visual Illusions: Graphical and Analytic Approaches For Finding Structure in Real-World Cases.*

---

## Project Structure

- `_data/` — Raw and formatted data
- `_data-processing/` — Scripts for data wrangling
- `_figs/` — Final figure outputs
- `_make-figs/` — Scripts to generate figures
- `_make-tab/` — Scripts to generate tables
- `_manuscript-latex/` — LaTeX manuscript files
- `_media/` — Supplemental media (e.g., images, videos)
- `_results/` — Model output files (excluded if over 100MB)
- `_script/` — Core analysis scripts
- `manuscript.pdf` — Final compiled paper (for reference)
- `README` — This file

---

## Citation

If you use or refer to this work, please cite:

> Mehrvarz, M., Popat, H., & Rouder, J. N. (2024). *Individual Differences in Visual Illusions: Graphical and Analytic Approaches For Finding Structure in Real-World Cases.*

